              <head>19</head>
              <p>ἐωθας</p>
              <note type="source">Ἀραφώς. Photius et Suidas ἐωθώς. cf. Archipp. 48.</note>
            </div>
            <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="20" xml:id="kock-0415-adelon_dramaton-20" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0415_adelon_dramaton">
              <head>20</head>
              <p>κοκκυμηλέαν, κοκκύμηλον</p>
              <note type="source">Athenaeus 2, 50b Ἀραφὼς δὲ κοκκυμηλέαν καλεῖ τὸ δένδρον, κοκκύμηλον δὲ τὸ ἀκρόδρυον. κοκκυμηλίαν BCD. Pollux 1, 232 κοκκύμηλον μὲν οὐδετέρως ὁ καρπός, ἀρσενικῶς δὲ τὸ δένδρον καλεῖ ἡ μέση κωμῳδία, ὁ κοκκύμηλος.</note>
              <note type="apparatus">unde Casaubonus in Athenaeo τὸν κοκκύμηλον pro κοκκυμηλέαν. at arborum frugiferarum nomina maximam partem in ἐα (ῆ) desinunt.</note>
            </div>
            <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="21" xml:id="kock-0415-adelon_dramaton-21" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0415_adelon_dramaton">
              <head>21</head>
              <p>χορτάζεσθαι</p>
              <note type="source">Ἀραφώς. Pollux 6, 43. cf. Eubul. 7, 5. 30, 1.</note>
            </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="18" xml:id="kock-0415-adelon_dramaton-18" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0415_adelon_dramaton">
              <lg>
                <l n="1" xml:id="kock-0415-adelon_dramaton-18-l1" xml:lang="grc">ἔργον δουλικόν</l>
              </lg>
              <note type="source">Ἀραρώς. Pollux 3, 75. indicavit H. Iacobi Mein. ed. min. xvi.</note>
            </div>
